      "writtenOn": "2025-05-20T19:34:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I just checked my Ti50. This is correct. \n\nThe FPMCU UART is read-only until CCD is unlocked. Just like the EC.\n\nThe AP is read-write by default.\n\n```\n  UartGscRxAPTx    Y 0\u003dDefault (Always)\n  UartGscTxAPRx    Y 0\u003dDefault (Always)\n  UartGscRxECTx    Y 0\u003dDefault (Always)\n  UartGscTxECRx    Y 0\u003dDefault (IfOpened)\n  UartGscRxFpmcuTx Y 0\u003dDefault (Always)\n  UartGscTxFpmcuRx Y 0\u003dDefault (IfOpened)\n```",
